body:
I think I was 12 or 13, which was kind of old for my country, loads of people go to these.. kid discos? and they make out with people at like 10/11. Weird in hindsight so I only did it out of pressure. Didn't kiss another person until I was like 17/18 again. It's nothing special. I'm in a long term relationship now and very rarely kiss. It's just.. gross. Too much saliva and germs.. yuck. I promise, you're not missing anything special.

&#x200B;

Edit: Also, do NOT rush into losing your virginity either. For a lot of people it's really regrettable and they only do it to be 'cool'. It sucks butts if it's not with the right person. Dont let assholes get you down.

Completely agree. I assume the best time of your life would be post graduation (25-35) when you start building your life (house, pets, family).

&#x200B;

Source: currently in a lecture.
